{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "I need to flag an important constraint on Cell 4. My commissioning review, completed this morning, found that Cell 4's newly installed fixture requires exactly 2 hours of setup verification before it can be used, and Cell 4 is approved for no more than 1,200 modules during this campaign. This note hasn't been entered into the production schedule yet, so it wouldn't show up in the system. This means Cell 4's capacity is capped at 1,200 modules and we need to account for the 2-hour setup verification in the timeline."}
```

